   "text": {
    "L1": "Communication means sharing a message with someone who understands it.",
    "L2": "A message can share an idea, a feeling or information.",
    "L3": "We can use words, such as talking, letters, phone calls and text messages.",
    "L4": "We can also communicate without words, using gestures, facial expressions, signs and pictures.",
    "L5": "Sign language is a real language with fixed signs, and different countries can have different sign languages.",
    "L6": "The best way depends on the need: a wave helps nearby, while a phone call reaches someone far away quickly.",
    "L7": "Now choose the best way for each situation."
   },
